  "content": "\n\n<p>本模组允许你拍摄更高分辨率的截图，特别是可以拍摄比当前屏幕分辨率大 2 倍、3 倍和 4 倍的截图。</p>\n<p>你可以使用模组新增的 3 个按键绑定之一来截图：\n<img src=\"https://assets.blamejared.com/bigshot/keybinds.png\" alt=\"按键绑定\"></p>\n<p>以下是不同分辨率截图的示例：</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fassets.blamejared.com%252fbigshot%252f1x.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">1 倍分辨率 (2560x1377) (4.2MB)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fassets.blamejared.com%252fbigshot%252f2x.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">2 倍分辨率 (5120x2754) (15.8MB)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fassets.blamejared.com%252fbigshot%252f3x.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">3 倍分辨率 (7680x4131) (34.1MB)</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fassets.blamejared.com%252fbigshot%252f4x.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">4 倍分辨率 (10240x5508) (56.4MB)</a></p>\n<p>如果你希望支持我的模组开发工作，可以通过 <strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/jaredlll08\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/CAJuExT.png\" alt=\"Patreon 标志\"> Patreon</a></strong> 成为我的赞助者。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://assets.blamejared.com/nodecraft/jared.jpg\" alt=\"Nodecraft 赞助横幅\"></a></p>\n<p><strong>本项目由 Nodecraft 赞助。使用优惠码 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnodecraft.com%252fr%252fjared\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">JARED</a>，首月服务立减 30%！</strong></p>",
